{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1213,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5a756fcdf499173351f12d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽前辈虽然稍微有点可怕……\r\n但那份无懈可击的气场真令人向往。",
      "source_fingerprint": "234970a4319669cc66a6da6f53456b2003fe1658231f422b27642861eb69acf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e08f98028a3050132f8ede4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个王冠头饰，很适合我吧？\r\n这可是妈妈为了庆祝我考上\r\n特雷森学园而送给我的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d586c0d50854e41893fb7a941f3daa068837ba897f389b3c3bf9818d405ffe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:526d70762962acc23eb02494",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速子小姐很温柔啊。\r\n不但分给我好喝的茶叶。\r\n而且有时还会送一些有用的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cffc0c40d73732847288446672c7190ae9819893b26a0c4c6e3ed75d4854bb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97364ff2c2542aac7904e761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……今天的电视占卜……\r\n居然是第二名这么微妙的名次……\r\n虽然不讨厌但也谈不上喜欢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "108521da1d40419db886a7357496de449c42bf7d6e053c5f8b00fb4cf7ba1332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3ec81843022965ddcd3ac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，别发呆了！\r\n时间都浪费了不是嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0caf09668ea2599b51d4feb92a6210966f3c402ccd5aed53bcab8b1fb78153bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdcbc9728b7e8527abddb221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜…总感觉衣服有点…又变紧了？\r\n哈啊～…待会得去改改。也得考虑到\r\n还处于成长期的情况呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9674beb8139e5492fadf385268d71278a4e23ae5a972bb2a85389a1641f13b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27a2ff0b6c0913718d7af551",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最快最强的完美马娘……\r\n我觉得自己正在一点点地接近理想了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "718a57dae2e4923fc30062774dcb33781107253cdd9b75160f857ba2a961d495",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49fcb252af1998798c6b3dab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得在赛场上留下能够称得上\r\n这件衣服的成果呢……那么今天也请\r\n严格地训练我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdeadd2d531ef0f3691e6b811bc63bd238ff7bbbb6dd24936a2cb5b86d450f5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:461f757d188d49231c4dc5df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时何地，无论对方是谁！\r\n都要第一个冲过终点！\r\n这就是我的原则！",
      "source_fingerprint": "976cd5779111e7eaf346a39c539df00841755a1df3dabd49dcf9f4a6c2cef93f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3af2fff0f90f4aee72e4235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？如果第一个到校，\r\n比任何人都快一步开始晨练的话，\r\n心情就会变得很好哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd68fa1429d0d73a59b4c094a271c5b5537b4c2d536f645afa3bdef1a061a063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e9eb21d416a23956596e97f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不好，训练前\r\n必须要买点香蕉才行！\r\n营养可不能跟不上呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03fc6024fdac8e4fdc1eee17cf6713a501489667e0badacf686904599777231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6cfe29233019c5520aed9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想在晚上点些熏香的，\r\n但伏特加说什么“这样会睡不踏实的！”。\r\n非要阻止我这么做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d41e2c21b013891a9714e873456fc6c3041386d86f5476f32278840cae7c460",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5167fee5325a86b39bb2abd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说“春眠不觉晓”，\r\n但如果要以第一为目标的话，\r\n可没有睡懒觉的时间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777bd5b967c5a989783f5d1c4158e9871c0508ee90214ce6a750d04cdd37af46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ce2a35ccba69594e84b488",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天真好啊！\r\n因为白天的时间变长了，\r\n可以进行更多的锻炼呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3040eed915e012bd39bf3fef4df9188cefed85b4789c62fbc77018d508566cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e1c0abe223ed27e5d4658c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，虽说到了秋天，\r\n但你不会吃特别多吧？\r\n要好好克制住哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a91835a5217bfcdf6d2892010ec0ad50fe66b6a5dc07be31081ff235f49c9a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c50d8472d50219bcebb1924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷……什么的才没有啦！\r\n这种程度，完全没问题！\r\n喂，要开始训练了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9bd929b5d4fb144030895c4da3f32c82d2446da8fc749fef1c74558773c76d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c4c55b3707c32ea9e1c01e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摩托车模型准备好了，包装也很完美，\r\n接着就只要……唔！不、不是的！\r\n这是……呃……总之不是那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b6e9f03d02e59491f7165834e514499cb6847d0eaaa087476c23cf6931a7b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d618bc21a11b79ce4c6be881",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～气槽前辈……那跟大人\r\n都能对等交谈的样子，好帅气喔。\r\n总有一天我也想象她那样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a70c4b91a121e0458927ba7ea64b0e9b20c7d3b411ac3ea19aba1fda5d8d5b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a154c556d8854089aa4aaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桂冠她很擅长缠运动贴布喔！\r\n我实在太佩服，就忍不住\r\n请她开课教我诀窍了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac08edbfe684faf759af019ac45820b84ea2db597ba59a657a22fb2b845fbac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adffb4f7ef15facf4d31e7fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白仁她……之前看到我抱着一堆\r\n笔记本，就为我打开办公室的门……\r\n得好好谢谢她才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23fbdfdf65304c5e520acf2818a3341f1d811570a1c3db73b1912479ca2f67d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a37673675c75c7089cd50256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "印象中小时候我都会非常期待\r\n圣诞节早晨到来呢。\r\n因为一定能见到爸爸妈妈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ca3934ea8f6a83a2d54dd4092ece34f0236bf1373949a35f6ba52c06cf7cc64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd6a1006cd05111da283eba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拉起靴子拉链的瞬间，就会感到\r\n精神为之一振。这是我的开关，\r\n提醒我要完美地度过一整天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e115e1bebd9f6a6aaa7d1c87c6810526975bf7d7f7401f6300d6b73fb0bc733",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6680e9292b42ac195469bca1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速子她对我说\r\n「你真是浑身充满荧光素呢」……\r\n而且，声音非常温柔……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4df54e713625b44d6f3403be4e1eadcce34c3ccc6e504d048867dd0020fde9e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff3ae17febdd715653dcc12e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……在训练员室里\r\n挂上袜子再回去怎么样？\r\n说不定……会发生好事喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5f7d39ada414c25242294fffe49992d63a04ed742a88bca4a15681799c5ed90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e11f7c93481be6bec31372e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真弓看着我说\r\n「采下来品尝吧～」\r\n……下次我要去采草莓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bfd9ead27dba0396f6de2dbc21cce80b76c3e94ee6408a54cfd05d15717f3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9140a7bd6a1f8c3c4cba7bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服并没有看起来那么热喔。\r\n它有露出肌肤，只要头发绑起来\r\n其实满凉爽的。剩下的……靠毅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c362d4a5dd6299d0af2ed23c2f452c20c429bdc7cb7f96a3a55e5039c050ea8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7cdfdcfcc4af29ef7020210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节充满诱惑，但没问题。\r\n只要看着穿上礼服的自己，\r\n就会想要好好保持身材！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a60816812bb7d565f00e349cde2c78083f9080db04fbd6ae4c30dd030d16360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb04b1dc2dce632fae48a264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "话说回来……每到这个时期，\r\n奖券藏都会拿着眼镜，\r\n不时地偷瞄我……为什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e7b661c390c48a5bea766d054eab409cf2f42d1430bc246d219cde764af2c93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f8bad5485d33142c719fa58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最中意的地方是「高级感」！\r\n布料质地很厚实，蕾丝也很细致……\r\n制作技巧真是太专业了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7933d73fc98fdbd9a81242c0076e3dcbb62893af6f4a1391da834b67ca953f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ccf81d70d8a17379756b38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头发上的珍珠？啊……是伏特加说\r\n「点缀一些应该很适合你」……\r\n她偶尔也满有品味的。偶尔啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b79fdee0c2e96c292682d603140ebbea3654451e1fe68ead86038b936dbd474a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ed3dad9710bee602c8fc34b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的计划是什么？\r\n如果是半吊子的训练的话可饶不了你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30b14191329eec7a5f1928d0cfd602c3e3b031da3e0281f6d6315bad985f75a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d1f1fcb9e83cb304fe585f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30018edfb0c3e6d25822efc176770762d5cfe5ec512b78949f6d10d3a4aee7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41dbc97af53ea5e8d5e6829b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的目标可是顶点。\r\n所以跑的量必须要比谁都要多才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "559cd35bec74082087fae74e6777338154e5ace7efa8ae9ea7fdd912bf1a7a17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e739bbcc7bba9b660c0c30e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热身运动也做完了……准备好了哟！\r\n无论多么艰苦的训练都完美地做给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f072f5005926baadc8965aaf8f1c27554b9d1e79efec71530e8ede7e6bbbb1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da03e9f03f826aa200b29619",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管对方有多强大。\r\n我都不想让出第一名的位置。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcc408451c80bd103a43ce60e0fc78df732cc02f4388a7d79b0d4f3250c055ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e22dbf629c4a3b57768b1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会比平时更卖力的！\r\n真想快点成为比赛的第一名，\r\n站在那个舞台上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42bb64805948a8c4b9c69950e55ef365314bc06b294681faa22f6853182870fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a4c510965e09ee829503975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近，有了自己变快了的实感呢！\r\n当然，我可不会满足于此的！\r\n我还会变得更快的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0eb274d27b28090b373fcdd3b86ce41146cc7a7b86cb30b0cb11bea577c8631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ace4c249347fc48ebc7941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由你推敲出的最棒的训练清单，\r\n我可是很期待哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc6d82785c139aa0d199caf431c495dfb8465148b41ef88d6af27315337440a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4491cb24a3e671d72fa90d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别磨蹭了，\r\n赶紧开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "329ed1f2b5531ea2683d786b3547e2d28a29f03291ac050ad5e5fa0e315b4523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7421b2aec1de6da37181e99b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奔跑时亮片会闪闪发光，非常漂亮！\r\n接下来只要以第一名跑完比赛，\r\n就能演出完美的场面了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "accd8dae95bf3e62634bff4e0082218f24fb0646f48feb39ebefa10ed34b4be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6284b76ce02e8ca410b4c765",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算不是真正的圣诞老人，\r\n我也可以……靠奔跑\r\n带给大家梦想！对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ef131f9f2afb9c2ba615b0e8d94bda6f96b82c4b56be2cd795b10a7594839b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7d5e7b1f86234694d5b2e3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，我想要做亮相圈的练习！\r\n我想设计适合这套礼服、\r\n最闪亮华丽的动作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a1817396e73fed2373945fe4c898f1406e7fca36508fd083d7ca87802c4a05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae7f8bef920d4aeb204b0dd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个发饰上的铃铛不会响喔！\r\n不过，就算发出声音，\r\n跑步时应该也会被脚步声盖过就是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf3b9490943a16749ca9e5cce9d5943f35eaad7d4ef79871c5c4a2c7541c154",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79673b2ff3fa80535e87a559",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有必要点灯。\r\n我要让大家看到，\r\n我自己就会散发光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6248d786f19a3de32722215d4b67ede68c4ad0cd56055e9f0ba2386136a8cd54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb82411d11e666fdcc49f2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想送给未来的自己\r\n一份最棒的礼物。\r\n所以现在我要加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bd6794e988be30e020de0fac64b5419ccfc5ab786575f89b629da9dc37afd17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc1ef34dc509f8e7f433a4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等一下，你刚刚在看礼服吧！\r\n真是的，集中精神啦！\r\n……之后会再让你慢慢看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a5d9ce63957e7e1c08b0972d43bcd3e12a46a9ddacef1a58633052f6af2a7ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efe6e9d371ffcc868b138579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵！能和你一起以第一名为目标，真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91edd14a77a76962c77f718a18ffa0670ba644b2341f9f84c5c363c8e6b570b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b26a6fa483e623e3ca0ce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做到了呢！就稍微认可你一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb7c3951bdad54d348945a61ad2f036dae9fd721c2f18b0488395ba4da6d7f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e9ade3e0da5be56edccb53e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是否也照亮了你的心？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac71139223a1c6e30d92766e758f015844b38da192a831d78d03299af0d6ab53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1106a9846bd73ee017c02d68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢……至少今天得坦率点，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea73bd93e778703642d32c0dcde28d40bf1b123f87b278690c96193300bc125",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b643bb70a91661631bae1cf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会变得更强的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06b0b8ca7e5d3b1e9009f932e2607b14041a5a7492f689fbd3bf0c58c075c853",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4597edae0a745243e37d8ddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的话……好像能成为第一名呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ff9077163417325e290614f6d054bcb089cf20bce3f729a9a84b6a7b14ad4fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:992d8814a7bfd3436c2af718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥，要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15b0e6dd7a91f9ab7e1c188b279565d0b3d568d0bd20feea979b65618fefdd36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d73efd49eb0a98981812c33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支援什么的就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "012685e5cd672b68748f55d44829fa075682151a113e78d772c726387693fe88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eeca8f81880a2618cc8d407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是支援方面，我也是第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d161a79dd67995392318211eab05adf2f3b033026e222e86439c46bec5ffc2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baaef6fb8f2e99cc45af0db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉甚至能奔驰在夜空当中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f39c635aa867f4c612c24d4ec41d72c1a8ab452a794afb37c40046226f8f677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dad5dff238752b85b93ba1b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家的愿望，\r\n我会全部实现的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d549b53b6a065c17b63f0ff4a0b8fdffac00c9c380a8622623349853050722cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:809de96e3fd76f1286ad9d13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算身在灯饰之中\r\n我也是最美丽的……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b52c32c4b4dbb5fff8d2cd5fd712133dafe5a5c8f869749d871409884fa4d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e818ca49a8423629814667f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是大和赤骥！\r\n好孩子在哪里呀～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6d529d4b313906e85131b40191012c36bfb3a8549f16bb34872e08cd94b9d3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cfd5d4f2bfeb47255a4226e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的目标是Victory！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c20d959a862cce0c8d7bfa27001c05172731976e306bfa29a9bff1c2880be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:476636f1121830713151c535",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的爸爸有话要我转达给训练员哦！\r\n「谢谢你一直对我女儿的照顾」Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56c92170f98f08c331d2ae91c9cf517cc37652a5618f774bb4963817ca80e3cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26df6051d1aa384586b16479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきマース！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9b5fb7ff0ad3afc7d92f8156624aaf2643275344dd063f08d0715c3add77f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3294b1f116cf099a3c60ac8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまデス！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c11fadecfbf6e4b48e2085f8344bfae8d67b1d6fa8ed2be6f763854ceb585cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4b473351f10b78977ce336",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "BANG！！\r\n训练员的Heart也被我击中了Death♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "159d3a8b515bbf5ee20a7fdc37758b4ae0d1c2f36644f9733f8082a8f05d0dc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5372abbb26afa4153ec59f2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚来日本时是有一点点不安的。\r\n但现在……每天都很Happy哦♪\r\n因为有训练员在我身边嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc8173f5d9329a3ec540f6daaf24b9709b1bce111a90e2e35492bf203e31d25b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61a8ddf99608fde61716b476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "A、HAPPY、NEW YEAR☆\r\n今年也麻烦你照顾了！\r\n请收下……今年第一个抱抱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb9e54168ba5bb4c45e33a124089e2bc9f01bd095696fdf9a1c16e81181cdce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:895c782835788acd4c4d194d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Valentine！\r\n我要送给训练员很多感谢的话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa446a69576e437a8a0a81afccc7c80f91cabe3d5f50a03ea67650144fa1ae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b6ffb8031ec817ae6098ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的巧克力特别不一样！\r\nLove跟Size都多了100倍Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c835ae12454f2bae2f7a00c28be60a8fa5e9fa2e76b5dd1ca49da4fb6337c9d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f6475aef80b2b25c6cc4bbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕的愿望，\r\n我连训练员的份都写好了哦！\r\n是「一起当上Champion」哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "773142b4469bb2cd44b3bdac0c3b88e3727477b015a9c54a3656c61c21ae2183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076c1291844f01582a6a6ec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，今天路上有好多可爱的鬼Death。\r\n要给大家很多点心哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5ee69d6019e33f4629d51e24c58fb5c709061f47cddd2f3288c8c8e13c7e74e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89064dbd05125ce6587c516b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Holiday！\r\n要用Turkey来Party Death！\r\n请训练员负责做吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b706d40c6ed146bb8b15839906ab62ae4b060e924383b2874c41ad2706f896",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:299246ed00ed735a43d891a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Christmas的街上\r\n到处都亮晶晶的呢！\r\n……一起从学园偷跑出去看看吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a337a3c1be43242410ebb66a9fba94b8793180623cd36742397ad7e26d9961d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a911582815e0941fdd5ddb77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes，Victory！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a7df3d5bcbecadc309cb611595d1ebc8508b1a1034bf3be4e3e41880a9ea974",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c23b01d855cd29e4d4dda19b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然New Year Kiss不行……\r\n但New Year抱抱OK哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f023813bdce5c0b3678d098743fb8a38d3fc6ff5e7f7f14a57b0282cb526536b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64b8e489587ed4c1cba79948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Birthday！\r\n我们今后也要一起制造\r\nPrecious的回忆哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f7c260eed136fa0bb094620a206592fb39ea881ac2f5c5ce4ceaf61a8208372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71a300fd3fbd686f487b6438",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今晚有特别的Party哦！\r\n因为是世界第一的训练员生日嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "495e816d53f8f997a294bb4f9609a1c488180fac1f39d126591119c967a5e80c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd01aacd1dd5a2e3935a319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "HAHAHA！又变得更成熟了呢！\r\n我们就用牛奶混牛奶来干杯吧Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4282e6eb2d4d6dbbdbd83a83107a29ff3dc2aa9bf8a29be5933804652378dff5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05e590885c56f03ef4bb0e7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今晚是我的Birthday Party♪\r\n训练员的位子当然是……\r\n在我的旁边咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b161bb77b837d7c1f872dbd2e0bbb4716e383d5f41376aecb7638d15c6eca76b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b4bf2f8400cdc88947b79f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公告……Oh，是News啊！\r\n确认看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3782df9c60e40065f2cfd62e6ff6fad7b1ffb4f3d618f5e2801cb800e3d1c2d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6111dcecaaa07620e2dbbd25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇！收到Present了Death！\r\n也请给我看看里面装着什么吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ece23a78673d5dca82c912e11d086c7220bc0a3ed5134217b5afc1793173f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "10016"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
